        <item>
            <title>3.10.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 00:26:20 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>175</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.10.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Control API: `open_session` now returns a `replyId`, so `wait_turn` can wait for the first answer of a session started with a prompt
- Control API: a refused `send_message` carries a `reasonCode` (`dead`, `permission_pending`, `asking`, `queue_full`)
- Control API: new read-only `pending_requests` verb lists outstanding permission prompts and AskUserQuestion prompts; `canopyctl pending` exposes it

### Bug Fixes
- Opening a session that was started through the control API no longer shows an empty chat until the next reply arrives; its history appears right away
]]></description>
