        <item>
            <title>3.9.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 22:32:20 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>174</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.9.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- A local control API lets scripts and agents drive daemon sessions: send a message, check status, read the latest reply, and wait for a turn to finish. `scripts/canopyctl` is a command-line client for it.
- An initial prompt given when opening a session now runs even with no window attached.

### Changes
- Clearer notices when a session is stopped from another device.

### Bug Fixes
- Sessions now read the organization UUID from `.claude.json` when the Keychain has none.
]]></description>
